>>
Rule 26 (If input is complex, offset should be zero)
{v_1: tensor, v_2: int} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 10 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 11 then v_2 = 0
>>
Rule 27 (If the input is a bool tensor, it must be 1D or 2D)
{v_1: tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 0 then ndim(v_1) = 1 ∨ ndim(v_1) = 2
>>
Rule 28 (The size of the first dimension must be less than 2^31)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then shape(v_1, 0) < 2147483648
>>
Rule 29 (If input is a string tensor, it must be 1D or 2D)
{v_1: tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 12 then ndim(v_1) = 1 ∨ ndim(v_1) = 2
>>
Rule 30 (if input is a dtype tensor, it must be 0-dimensional.)
